TSCharacters.txt is included unmodified. CliRelay embeds it into the binary
(internal/contentmoderation/normalize.go) and reads the first candidate of
each single-character entry to fold Traditional Chinese into Simplified before
keyword matching, when a content moderation profile enables that option.
